; Original: Graveyard Relay. 16 bars, E minor; late Dorian glimmer.
; Looped mathematical waves and one synthesized kick; no WAV bank.
#title Graveyard Relay
#tempo 96
#grid 4
#inst veil triangle vol=26
#inst glass pulse12 vol=22 decay=2
#inst bass triangle vol=42 decay=1
#inst kick kick vol=34

; A: beacon fifth, falling third, unresolved second; silence between calls.
A @veil o3 q6 v15 e2 b4 g4 | f+2 r2
A e2 g4 b4 | a2 r4 g4
A g2 d4 b4 | a2 g4 r4
A f+2 a4 e4 | d+2 r2
A e4 b4 g4 f+4 | e2 r4 c+4
A e2 g4 b4 | a4 g4 e2
A g2 b4 a4 | g4 e4 d4 r4
A f+4 a4 g4 e4 | d+2 r2

; B: broken triads leave offbeat holes; C-natural becomes C-sharp in bar 10.
B @glass o4 q4 v15 [e8 b8 g8 r8 f+8 b8 g8 r8]2
B [c8 g8 e8 r8 d8 g8 e8 r8]2
B [o3 g8 o4 d8 b8 r8 a8 d8 b8 r8]2
B [o4 d8 a8 f+8 r8 e8 a8 f+8 r8]2
B e8 g8 b8 r8 f+8 g8 b8 r8 | e8 g8 c+8 r8 b8 g8 f+8 r8
B c8 e8 g8 r8 b8 g8 e8 r8 | c8 e8 a8 r8 g8 e8 d8 r8
B o3 g8 o4 b8 d8 r8 e8 d8 b8 r8 | g8 e8 d8 r8 b8 g8 e8 r8
B f+8 a8 b8 r8 a8 f+8 d+8 r8 | f+4 r4 r2

; C: bass and kick share the same physical voice.
C q6 v15 [@kick o4 c8 @bass o2 e4. @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 b4.
C @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 e4. @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 e4.
C @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 c4. @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 g4.
C @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 c4. @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 c4.
C @kick o4 c8 @bass o1 g4. @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 d4.
C @kick o4 c8 @bass o1 g4. @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 g4.
C @kick o4 c8 @bass o1 b4. @kick o4 c8 @bass o2 f+4.
C @bass o1 b4 r4 r2]2
D [r1]16
